OL,3,GNEWSAUK's first air taxi centre opens
OL,4,Aas we 'move closer to flying cars'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFuturistic air taxis that take off like
OL,7,Fhelicopters will be built at a new
OL,8,Ffacility that is the first of its kind
OL,9,Fin the UK.
OL,11,FBristol-based company Vertical
OL,12,FAerospace has announced a new aircraft
OL,13,Fassembly centre at Cotswold Airport,
OL,14,Fnear Kemble in Gloucestershire,
OL,15,Fdescribing it as a
OL,16,F"once-in-a-generation opportunity".
OL,18,FThe Valo aircraft currently being
OL,19,Fdeveloped and tested there are
OL,20,Felectric, carry four passengers and can
OL,21,Ffly up to 160km (100 miles) with no
OL,22,Foperating emissions, the firm said.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
